  "notes": "The Library has been rebuilt as a compiled C# WPF application. It keeps the existing cover database and stored panels, replaces the PowerShell/WinForms interface with the approved black-leather and antique-brass private archive, adds responsive grouped-set browsing and details, and preserves single-panel import, temporary full-wrap splitting, multi-wrap queues, Save All, Clear All, draggable guides, live previews, zoom, backups, restore, archive controls, native Windows snapping, and independent updates. No separate runtime installation is required."
